#: ui/app.slint:3011
msgid ""
"1. Syncing for this account pauses.\n2. The files go to the new place. On "
"the same drive they're simply moved, which is instant. To another drive "
"they're copied, which can take a while for a big folder.\n3. A check runs to "
"confirm everything matches online (a dry run, nothing changes). Press Apply "
"and syncing carries on from the new place."
msgstr ""

